---
import ReservationLink from './ReservationLink.astro';
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-copy"><div class="hero-heading"><h1 id="hero-title" class="hero-kicker">ワインがつなぐ、<br />心ほどける時間。</h1><img class="heading-rays" src="/illustrations/rays.svg" width="48" height="52" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></div><p class="hero-lead">気軽に楽しむワインと、心地よい会話。<br />おひとりでも、詳しくなくても。<br />日常の寄り道に、Degustaへ。</p><div class="hero-actions"><ReservationLink /><span class="welcome-note-wrap"><svg class="welcome-arrow" viewBox="0 0 42 34" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M38 28C25 30 11 23 9 7M3 13Q6 10 9 6L16 11" stroke="#a97834" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" /></svg><img class="welcome-art" src="/illustrations/welcome.svg" width="426" height="112" alt="お気軽にどうぞ！" /></span></div></div>
  <figure class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/degusta/store-hero.webp" width="1600" height="1200" alt="Degustaの丸窓と、明るい木のカウンター席" fetchpriority="high" /><span class="photo-note"><img class="photo-note-art" src="/illustrations/casual-wine.svg" width="74" height="70" alt="気軽に、ふらっとワインを" /><img class="badge-wine-icon" src="/illustrations/wine-glass.svg" width="42" height="62" alt="" aria-hidden="true" /></span></figure>
</section>
